'''''Early Days: Best of Led Zeppelin Volume One''''' is a compilation album by [[Led Zeppelin]], released by [[Atlantic Records]] on November, 23 [[1999]]. These tracks are selected from the [[1969]] to [[1972]] period in the band's history.

The album was #71 on debut on the [[Billboard Music Charts|Billboard]]'s Pop Albums chart.

==Track listing==
# &quot;[[Good Times, Bad Times]]&quot; 2:48 (From [[Led Zeppelin (album)|Led Zeppelin]])
# &quot;[[Babe I'm Gonna Leave You]]&quot; 6:41 (From Led Zeppelin)
# &quot;[[Dazed and Confused]]&quot; 6:27 (From Led Zeppelin)
# &quot;[[Communication Breakdown]]&quot; 2:29 (From Led Zeppelin)
# &quot;[[Whole Lotta Love]]&quot; 5:34 (From [[Led Zeppelin II]])
# &quot;[[What Is and What Should Never Be]]&quot; 4:44 (From Led Zeppelin II)
# &quot;[[Immigrant Song]]&quot; 2:25 (From [[Led Zeppelin III]])
# &quot;[[Since I've Been Loving You]]&quot; 7:24 (From Led Zeppelin III)
# &quot;[[Black Dog (song)|Black Dog]]&quot; 4:54 (From [[Led Zeppelin IV]])
# &quot;[[Rock and Roll (Led Zeppelin song)|Rock and Roll]]&quot; 3:41 (From Led Zeppelin IV)
# &quot;[[The Battle of Evermore]]&quot; 5:52 (From Led Zeppelin IV)
# &quot;[[When the Levee Breaks]]&quot; 7:08 (From Led Zeppelin IV)
# &quot;[[Stairway to Heaven]]&quot; 8:02 (From Led Zeppelin IV)

==Personnel==
*[[Jimmy Page]] - Acoustic and electric guitars, producer
*[[Robert Plant]] - Vocals and harmonica
*[[John Paul Jones (musician)|John Paul Jones]] - Bass guitar, keyboards, and mandolin
*[[John Bonham]] - Drums and percussion
*[[Sandy Denny]] - Vocals on &quot;Battle of Evermore&quot;

==Additional notes==
Enhanced CD contains a promo video for the studio version of &quot;Communication Breakdown&quot;, matched to television footage from Sweden [[1969]].

Catalogue: Atlantic 7567832682
{{LedZeppelin}}

[[sv:Early Days: Best of Led Zeppelin Volume One]]</text>
