      <text xml:space="preserve">There have been two people, contemporaries from [[Quebec]], named '''Alphonse Desjardins''':

* [[Alphonse Desjardins (co-operator)|Alphonse Desjardins]], founder of [[Mouvement Desjardins]] [[credit union]]s
* [[Alphonse Desjardins (politician)|Alphonse Desjardins]], mayor of [[Montreal]] and [[Canadian cabinet]] minister

