# [[Darlene]]
# [[Black Country Woman]]
# [[How Many More Times]]
# [[The Rover (song)|The Rover]]
# [[Four Sticks]]
# [[Hats Off To (Roy) Harper]]
# [[I Can't Quit You Baby]]
# [[Hots On For Nowhere]]
# [[Living Loving Maid (She's Just A Woman)]]
# [[Royal Orleans]]
# [[Bonzo's Montreux]]
# [[The Crunge]]
# [[Bring It On Home]]
# [[Tea For One]]

==Personnel==
