      <minor />
      <comment>Explanations</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Category:Led Zeppelin albums]]
[[Category:1990 albums]]

[[Image:LedZeppelinProfiledcover.jpg|right|]]

'''''Profiled''''' is an interview album by [[Led Zeppelin]], released by [[Atlantic Records]] on [[September 21]], [[1990]]. ''Profiled'' was a promo-only interview CD made to accompany the recently-released ''[[Led Zeppelin (box set)|Led Zeppelin]]'' [[box set]]. It was later bundled with a special edition ''[[Led Zeppelin Remasters]]''.

==Track listing==
:1. &quot;Led Zeppelin Profile&quot; This track is a compilation of various bits of the following interviews, and lengthy selections from songs.&lt;br&gt;
:2-8. &quot;Station Liners&quot; These are brief generic soundbites recorded by Jimmy Page for playing on the radio (e.g. &quot;I'm Jimmy Page, and I'm ready to rock.&quot;)&lt;br&gt;
:9-20. &quot;Interview: Jimmy Page&quot;&lt;br&gt;
:21-32. &quot;Interview: Robert Plant&quot;&lt;br&gt;
:33-43. &quot;Interview: John Paul Jones&quot;&lt;br&gt;

==Additional notes==

Catalogue: Atlantic PRCD36292
{{LedZeppelin}}</text>
